Ratchet Quest VR: the bundled Multiplayer at OpenRAC's mod list's release, 0.12.2.

A party needs the same Multiplayer version in every game. The pinned openrac-mods master says
0.12.3 (unreleased: only its verbose log's folder moved), OpenRAC's mod list gives 0.12.2, so a
Quest game would show as "(differs)" to PC players. This puts the version back to 0.12.2 (the
manifest, HELLO's version, OPENRAC_MOD_CPP, the README's packet table and history) and keeps
0.12.3's one change, the verbose log in the mod's data folder: on a Quest the working directory
is "/", where mp-trace.log does not open (0.1.19 to 0.1.22 put it there).

Upkeep: when OpenRAC's mod list moves to a newer Multiplayer, move RAC1_MODS_PIN
(tools/build_quest.py) to that release's commit and drop this patch, or remake it with the
release's version: git -C <openrac-mods> diff HEAD -- multiplayer/README.md
multiplayer/openrac-mod.json multiplayer/src/mod_state.hpp multiplayer/src/multiplayer.cpp
(0002 touches none of these files). docs/MULTIPLAYER.md lists what each patch is for.

